# Keen32 -warp 1 -script with KDREAMS.CFG that has the first joystick as the control of the player 0 (Prova-Dispositivi.ps1 -Control 2)
# The stick at the right end of the game port walks Keen to the right, at the left end back, the button jumps.
wait 150
shot j1.png
joy 1900 1000
wait 30
shot j2.png
joy 100 1000
wait 40
shot j3.png
joy 1000 1000
joybuttons 1
wait 20
shot j4.png
joybuttons 0
quit
